  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Смертельный залп [Killing Volley].</strong> Смертельный залп [Killing Volley] tears shape from the Winds of Magic and forces it into a weaponized moment: bright, cold, hungry, or cruel according to the lore that birthed it.</p><p><strong>Mechanics.</strong> Casting uses action at range 60 ft. Targets make a Intelligence saving throw against the caster's spell save DC; on a failed save, apply 4d6 piercing damage.</p><blockquote><p>\"Victory belongs to the hand that does not tremble at dusk.\"<br><em>- Old World magister</em></p></blockquote>",
      "chat": "Casting uses action at range 60 ft. Targets make a Intelligence saving throw against the caster's spell save DC; on a failed save, apply 4d6 piercing damage."
